  m_Name: G5- Letter
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Octobass.Waves.Item.LoreItemDefinition
  Name: G5- Letter
  Text: "Fifth Princess of Aftercastle,\r\n\r\nWe have received your request for
    aid, to help with dealing with the tyranny of your father. Unfortunately we cannot
    honour our previous alliance at this time as our own borders are under threat,
    as I\u2019m sure you are well aware, from the north. \r\nWe will engage again
    if our situation improves.\r\n\r\nKind Regards,\r\nPrince John Tubinian\r\n"
